    ns1:hasDataType "Clinical Routine",
        "Longitudinal",
        "PROMs" ;
    ns1:hasDataUseRestriction "Reuse of data of SPHN-SPAC is described in the SPHN-SPAC Data Project Consortium Agreement. Briefly, data may be shared under the prerequisites listed in the SwissPedHealth General Terms and Conditions (GTC), if they meet the following conditions: 1. the Project Executive Board must approve the sharing the data, 2. If the data includes personal information, each person or group that provided the data must give their individual, written consent, 3. Only parties or third parties who have signed an agreement with all project members (and approved by the Project Executive Board) can access the data.4. The sharing of data must follow all relevant laws, particularly those about human research and data usage, 5. The data cannot be used for profit or commercial purposes, 6. If required by law, the sharing must have approval from ethical committees or other relevant authorities. Contact point: claudia.kuehni@unibe.ch." ;
    ns1:hasFundingOrganization [ a foaf:Organization ;
            rdfs:label "Swiss Personalized Health Network" ;
            foaf:homepage <https://sphn.ch> ] ;
    ns1:hasInclusionCriteria "Enrolled in SPAC for the SPAC data, or patients who visited the pneumology clinics between the period and at the age described above and did neither participate in the SPAC study nor refuse the general consent for the non-SPAC data." ;
