        <https://www.biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-schema/sphn/2025/1> ;
    dcterms:description "The IICU dataset includes multiple data types including administrative records, demographic information, ICU monitor time series data, routine clinical data, laboratory and microbiological results, medication records, clinical outcomes, and various omics datasets collected from intensive care unit patients. It also contains detailed clinical annotations for infections, outcomes, and contextual interpretation. This rich and large scale dataset enables clinicians and machine learning researchers to better understand which interventions occurred and why, supporting expert informed and data driven assessment in ICU settings." ;
